@node whatis "What is ClassAction ?"


    @{b}ClassAction@{ub} is a little tool which will simplify the life of
    all hard disk users.

    When you own a hard disk, you have always a bunch of files :
    executables, modules, pictures, sources, animations, sounds...

    @{b}ClassAction@{ub} determine for you the kind of a selected file and
    displays a list of actions to perform on the file.

    For example, when you select a GIF picture, it will be recognized
    by ClassAction as a GIF Class file, and a list of actions
    will be shown with Actions like 'Display' or 'Edit'.

    @{b}ClassAction@{ub} is also a full file manager with many options.
    Copy, move, rename, delete, add icons, show information, ...
    Just try it and you will see all the possibilities!

    @{b}ClassAction@{ub} is highly configurable:
    You can add your own classes and actions.
    Actions use external programs, so you can use your prefered
    Gif viewer to show your Gif Files (or anything else).
    Specify your own drive or directory buttons and your own shortcut keys.

    @{b}ClassAction@{ub} has an AppIcon, an Arexx port and is localized.

    @{b}ClassAction@{ub} uses xfdmaster.library to auto decrunch crunched files.
    With this feature, even a crunched class can be detected.

    If you take time to configure @{b}ClassAction@{ub}, you can do everything
    with it !!! It's an easy way to handle files.

    Before deciding to erase it, just try it !!!!!!


    If you want to know more about @{b}ClassAction@{ub} use @{" More " link more}

@endnode

